--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-enabled-false-iterator-3c9a2e7f14b08d61.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``enabled=False`` is now honoured by the iterator form of ``Retrying`` and
+    ``AsyncRetrying`` (``for attempt in`` and ``async for``). The body runs once
+    and any exception propagates unchanged, instead of retrying and raising
+    ``RetryError``. This matches the decorator path.
